{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SessionCoordinator","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":1,"text":"Architecture","type":"heading","anchor":"Architecture"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The coordinator owns three pieces of state:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The in-memory ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"state"},{"type":"text","text":" (handshaking \/ replaying \/ live \/ disconnected)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A persistent "},{"code":"(sessionId, lastSeq)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" cursor in "},{"code":"SessionStorage","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A heartbeat timer that fires while the connection is healthy."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It does ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" own the connection itself — that’s your transport’s"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"problem. The coordinator just decides what to send when you tell it"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“the connection is open” or “I received this frame”.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Lifecycle-the-seven-calls-youll-make","level":1,"text":"Lifecycle (the seven calls you’ll make)"},{"code":["\/\/ 1. On WebSocket connect:","await coordinator.connectionDidOpen()","       \/\/ → coordinator decides Identify vs Resume from storage,","       \/\/   asks transport to send the chosen handshake frame.","","\/\/ 2. On every incoming frame your decoder parses:","await coordinator.didReceive(.ready(sessionId: \"abc\", initial